#: src/ui/radio_control_widget.py:184
msgid ""
"Persistent per-transponder RX (downlink) offset, saved with this "
"transponder. If the satellite's actual frequency has drifted from nominal (e."
"g. TCXO aging), this value is continuously applied as a correction to this "
"transponder's center frequency -- before Doppler correction -- so it carries "
"over to every future pass and survives Tune (T). Positive shifts the "
"corrected frequency higher. Use Lock (L) instead for real-time manual "
"retuning within a single pass."
msgstr ""

